* Complete LTspice netlist for LTC4281 12V Hot Swap Controller
V1 IN 0 PWL(0 0 1m 12)

* Load
Rload OUT 0 12
Cout OUT 0 100u

* Sense Resistor (10mOhm sets 2.5A current limit)
Rsense IN SENSEN 0.01

* MOSFET
M1 SENSEN GATE OUT Mymos
.model Mymos VDMOS(Rg=2 Vto=2.0 Rd=5m Rs=1m Rb=5m Kp=60 Cgdmax=1n Cgdmin=100p Cgs=2n Cjo=1n Is=10p mfg=Generic Vds=30 Ron=5m Qg=30n)

* UV / OV Dividers
* UV threshold 1.22V -> sets UV to ~9.9V
R1 IN UV 71.5k
R2 UV 0 10k

* OV threshold 1.22V -> sets OV to ~15.0V
R3 IN OV 113k
R4 OV 0 10k

* Controller IC (29 pins, assuming pin 29 is the exposed pad tied to GND)
* Pins: 1:VDD 2:SENSEP 3:SENSEN 4:GATE 5:SOURCE 6:OUT 7:UV 8:OV 9:GND 10:INTVCC 
*       11:TIMER 12:ON 13:FAULTB 14:PWRGDB 15:VDDIO 16:SCL 17:SDAI 18:SDAO 19:ADIN 
*       20:ADR0 21:ADR1 22:ADR2 23:ALERTB 24:GPIO1 25:GPIO2 26:GPIO3 27:EEWP 28:GND 29:EP(GND)
X1 IN IN SENSEN GATE OUT OUT UV OV 0 INTVCC TIMER IN FAULTB PWRGDB INTVCC 0 0 SDAO 0 0 0 0 ALERTB 0 0 0 0 0 0 LTC4281

* Timing and Bypass Capacitors
Ctimer TIMER 0 0.1u
Cintvcc INTVCC 0 1u

* Pull-ups and Dummy Resistors for open-drain/floating outputs
R_fault FAULTB INTVCC 10k
R_pwrgd PWRGDB INTVCC 10k
R_sdao SDAO 0 1Meg
R_alertb ALERTB 0 1Meg

* Analysis (0.5s is enough to clear the 100ms internal delay and inrush)
.tran 0.5
.end
